From 8def0e127aee3c71a087e27a3c4dc162359e2733 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhou ziheng <jiaranran2@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:05:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: port DSV4 compressor tail workspace to vLLM 0.30 MRV2

Adapt fixed private C4/C128 tail rings to the current KV spec registry,
uniform scheduler cache planning and CircularBufferManager lifecycle.
Preserve immutable invocation history before tail overwrite and logical
SCFA page order. Keep CWS opt-in with CONTINUOUS as the disabled path.

Ported from vllm-project/vllm-ascend#15452, with history and page-order
repairs from jiangkuaixue123/vllm-ascend#3 and
jiangkuaixue123/vllm-ascend#4. Prefix checkpoints are
outside this port. Native bytes and runtime Python ASTs match the A3
device-tested implementation; submission cleanup only changes Python
formatting and test import order.

Signed-off-by: Zhou ziheng <jiaranran2@gmail.com>
